<title>FINLAND: LANNEN T SETS 5-YEAR FIM 100 MLN BOND.</title>
<headline>LANNEN T SETS 5-YEAR FIM 100 MLN BOND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish foodstuffs and animal feed group Lannen Tehtaat Oy said in statement on Monday it will launch a five-year bond with a 6.00 percent coupon on November 11.</p>
<p>The amount is 100 million markka and the issue price is variable. </p>
<p>The bond will be fully repaid on November 11, 2001, it said. Annual interest wil be paid on November 11.</p>
<p>A bourse listing will be sought for the bond after the subscription period, November 11-25, has ended.</p>
<p>OKOBANK is lead manager of the issue.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
